## Step 1: Bulk-Dump All Manifests into Text Files
Run this loop to instantly process all 17 APKs. It will create a human-readable text dump of each app's structure right next to the APK files:

cd /home/user/Downloads/waydroid_extracted_apks
for apk in *.apk; do
    echo "Dumping manifest for: $apk"
    aapt dump xmltree "$apk" AndroidManifest.xml > "${apk%.apk}_manifest.txt"done

